    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Fix a rule family, formal class labels, and resource bound for “easy,” then compare static rule-analysis algorithms against direct simulation on held-out rules. Complexity or undecidability results can establish stronger restricted impossibility statements.";
